SCOPE: High Elvis\'92s speech 
\f1 \cf2 \uc0\u8594 
\f0 \cf2  \'93Most Have Never Stirred\'94 recitation 
\f1 \cf2 \uc0\u8594 
\f0 \cf2  the \'93Religious Minds\'94 announcement 
\f1 \cf2 \uc0\u8594 
\f0 \cf2  the interleaved performance with its three confirmed cutaways (Sarah, Eloise, Humble) only. This is the last of 5 scenes decomposing Rock Against Revival\'92s first night; scenes 1\'964 (crowd/bands/three laws; platform/Eloise arrives; Sages hijack the stage; Chanta\'92s tower) are sibling scope, not to be duplicated here.\
\
